    "Cost": 8696940,
    "UIName": "Visor B",
    "Id": "vehicledef_VISOR_B",
    "Name": "Visor B",
    "Details": "The B configuration of the Visor Strike Vehicle is a reconnaissance vehicle with an extremely powerful close range punch. Most of its firepower comes from five turret-mounted Clan SRM-4 launchers, backed by a Clan Improved Heavy Medium Laser in the front and a Mine Dispenser. Its electronics are built around a Clan Active Probe and a Clan Angel ECM, and a Remote Sensor Dispenser lets it place sensors in the field.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 8/12 hexes / 240/360 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       155     20\n<b>Left</b>         110     20\n<b>Right</b>       110     20\n<b>Rear</b>        110     20\n<b>Turret</b>      110     20\n\n<b>Total</b>      595    100</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00>Can Resupply/Repair</color>",
    "Icon": "BurroTruck"
